{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"big\": \"X\",\n    \"small\": \"Y\",\n    \"core\": \"Y\",\n    \"concise\": \"Y\",\n    \"human\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\",\n    \"load\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"big：X的大块能独立交代人物当下的状态、原因和转折，例如想靠近、怕成为负担、收住喜欢、害怕失去，逐屏串联更清楚；Y只看加亮词时，S03、S07等屏少了念头消退、心里一紧等关键体验。small：Y的非加亮文字大多能补足人物关系和心理变化，衔接比较自然；X的小感受虽然丰富，但有时重复大字，例如S03念头淡了与念头沉回去、S10想笑又想哭与眼泪不必再忍。core：Y在S13明确呈现幸福没有消失、悲伤却进入幸福的状态，S14又以甜酸和不后悔收束，核心表达更集中。concise：Y把不少原本分散在大字和小字里的相近意思合并了，X有几处跨块重复；human：Y整体语序和口语表达更自然，X的“越觉得时间快”“情色性的暖意”等搭配略显生硬。fine：X的感受描写更有身体辨识度，例如“还没意识到怕什么就先握紧了”，比Y部分较概括的情绪描述更具体。load：Y的加亮块虽然数量较多，但大多较短，且意群边界清楚；X的大块数量少一些，却常常是一整段较长的句子，扫读负担略大。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "3be815be-5142-40cc-8dc5-5589d9418023", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T212637187541Z", "elapsed_seconds": 389.641, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T21:33:06.840486+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "2962027035bde86c34a79a25ead02efb842e1eba5b153867ea66ee5c04186516", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\